{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d07f0146def05358469b8fc546549d08c7984720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/a/7daeb59784444e689371af272bf2075195ec6e39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|1-|1+x||$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/8/c081ced9785620d1e9d1dfca8719c4943b8621a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 2+x \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }-2-x \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } x \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } -x \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"476\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef8362e1f78725beb1de44c30360f0a10d0d3c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/f/baf38ddc4ff19805f3d3c5788d43c9c1e73437c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|=-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c28242522f23e896074dc89612847f8317911d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdfa402367beef894cd8a52d8e919a594228bd23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d07f0146def05358469b8fc546549d08c7984720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa59fe2938acc23f615fc2a6106e22772133e551.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+x&lt;1-2&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e7283deab963458e3f4e977e2ce04bc13e3a2013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|1+x|=-x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/2/fd2109da2da757f18a489ecbae92972dfdc59722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-|1+x|=1+x+1=x+2&lt;-2+2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"358\" height=\"18\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d61bf80822945d2a8f2c53584b0f332c78da4ab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|1-|1+x||=|x+2|=-2-x, \\boxed{\\text{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"281\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></